#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:11
msgid "Distance Sensor (Ultrasonic)"
msgstr "距離センサー（超音波）"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:20
msgid "MaxBotix I2C Ultrasonic Sensor"
msgstr "MaxBotix I2C 超音波センサー"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:24
#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:31
msgid "MB1242"
msgstr "MB1242"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:34
msgid ""
"An Ultrasonic Distance Sensor is a device that is able to measure the "
"distance between an object and the sensor.  It does this by sending out a"
" sound wave and measuring the time it takes for the wave to travel to the"
" object and back. Using this and the speed of sound the distance can be "
"calculated."
msgstr ""
"超音波距離センサーは物体とセンサー間の距離を測定できるデバイスです。"
"音波を発信し、波が物体まで往復する時間を計測することで動作します。この時間と音速を使用して距離を計算します。"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:40
msgid "Distance Sensor (Optical)"
msgstr "距離センサー（光学式）"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:49
msgid "REV 2m Distance Sensor"
msgstr "REV 2m 距離センサー"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:53
#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:60
msgid "REV-31-1505"
msgstr "REV-31-1505"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:62
msgid ""
"An Optical Time of Flight (ToF) Sensor is a device that is able to "
"measure the distance between an object and the sensor. It does this by "
"sending out a light beam and measuring the time it takes for the beam to "
"travel to the object and back. Using this time and the known speed of "
"light the distance can be calculated. Be aware that the way the object in"
" question interacts with light can change the accuracy of the distance "
"measurement. A transparent object like field panels will often provide "
"inaccurate measurements."
msgstr ""
"光学式飛行時間（ToF）センサーは物体とセンサー間の距離を測定できるデバイスです。"
"光ビームを発射し、ビームが物体まで往復する時間を計測することで動作します。この時間と光速を使用して距離を計算します。"
"対象物の光との相互作用の仕方によって距離測定の精度が変わることに注意してください。フィールドパネルのような透明な物体はしばしば不正確な測定値を提供します。"

